abstract: >
  ViTeX-Bench is a benchmark suite for faithful and temporally consistent
  video scene text editing. It defines a thirteen-metric protocol over
  three axes (text correctness, visual quality, and edit locality) on a
  permanently frozen 157-clip evaluation split, and ships an open
  reference model (ViTeX-Edit-14B) anchored under the same protocol.
keywords:
  - video editing
  - scene text editing
  - benchmark
